{"4800020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadows of Imalor", "steam_appid": 4800020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5103550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shattered sky. A broken world. A memory lost to the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a crystal prison with no memory of who you are or how you arrived. All around you, the land is infused with the remnants of <strong>Divine Dust</strong>, the celestial fallout of an ancient cataclysm that shattered the veil between the mortal and the divine world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Lord Lars Blackwing </strong>has claimed the <strong>Crown of Whisperers</strong> and is waging a brutal war to siphon the world's fading celestial power. You must forge your path, master raw combat and magic, and discover the truth of your past before the kingdom falls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore in singleplayer or co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/9af3f608949d766767d6864cdc162239.poster.avif?t=1788205971\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/9af3f608949d766767d6864cdc162239.webm?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/9af3f608949d766767d6864cdc162239.mp4?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embark on the entire campaign in local co-op or traverse the land as a lone wanderer. Journey across a huge hand-crafted world, solve unique puzzles to unlock new loot and abilities and defeat challenging bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer thrilling bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/3fdb7f82316bdcf6af69c99f9069cae1.poster.avif?t=1788205971\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/3fdb7f82316bdcf6af69c99f9069cae1.webm?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/3fdb7f82316bdcf6af69c99f9069cae1.mp4?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Test your reflexes and tactics against a wide array of legendary boss encounters. Survive the scorching flames of the <i>Crimson Dragon</i>, bring down the  <i>Giant Brothers</i>, or face the corrupted  power of the <i>Grimoire of Shadows</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/e68636f7e062704cc8efaa80ba120dda.poster.avif?t=1788205971\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/e68636f7e062704cc8efaa80ba120dda.webm?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/e68636f7e062704cc8efaa80ba120dda.mp4?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge your own custom class from a pool of 40+ unique spells and abilities. Combine heavy martial strikes, elemental forces, dark summoning and divine magic to sculpt a playstyle that is uniquely yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock powerful gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/722f0b00df94a0cd75c483ff530c7133.poster.avif?t=1788205971\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/722f0b00df94a0cd75c483ff530c7133.webm?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/722f0b00df94a0cd75c483ff530c7133.mp4?t=1788205971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip your character with an extensive array of weapons, shields, and armor sets. Upgrade your gear using <i>crystals</i> found throughout the world to transform into an unstoppable force.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shattered sky. A broken world. A memory lost to the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a crystal prison with no memory of who you are or how you arrived. All around you, the land is infused with the remnants of <strong>Divine Dust</strong>, the celestial fallout of an ancient cataclysm that shattered the veil between the mortal and the divine world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Lord Lars Blackwing </strong>has claimed the <strong>Crown of Whisperers</strong> and is waging a brutal war to siphon the world's fading celestial power. You must forge your path, master raw combat and magic, and discover the truth of your past before the kingdom falls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore in singleplayer or co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800020/extras/9af3f608949d766767d6864cdc162239.poster.avif?t=1788205971\" width=1170 heigh